# Internal docs — only the top-level README.md ships. Planning specs, ADRs, runbooks,
# benchmarks, and per-domain notes are internal and stay out of the repo. The prompt
# templates under backend/src/ai/prompts/ are runtime assets (not docs) and are kept.
/CLAUDE.md
/SPRINT-*.md
/docs/
/frontend/README.md
backend/src/**/README.md
backend/tests/**/README.md
